{"query_id": "rag_easy_long_remote_sensing_survey", "query": "从本地知识库中找出至少 5 篇遥感图像变化描述论文，逐篇说明核心方法。", "task_type": "rag_retrieval", "task_length": "long", "difficulty_level": "easy", "content_type": "unknown", "generation_mode": "handcrafted_task", "retrieval_enabled": true, "ground_truth_ids": ["2022_chenyang_liu_remote_dataset__chunk_0000", "Diffusion-RSCC_Diffusion_Probabilistic_Model_for_Change_Captioning_in_Remote__chunk_0005", "Cross-Temporal_Remote_Sensing_Image_Change_Captioning_A_Manifold_Mapping_and__chunk_0005", "SAM_Guided_Semantic_and_Motion_Changed_Region_Mining__chunk_0010", "Mask_Approximation_Net_A_Novel_Diffusion_Model_Approach_for_Remote_Sensing__chunk_0010"], "recall@5": 0.0, "precision@5": 0.0, "ndcg@5": 0.0, "hit@5": 0.0, "recall@10": 0.2, "precision@10": 0.1, "ndcg@10": 0.1021, "hit@10": 1.0, "recall@20": 0.2, "precision@20": 0.05, "ndcg@20": 0.1021, "hit@20": 1.0, "mrr": 0.1111, "success": false, "status": "degraded", "task_error": "verification=no_evidence", "has_answer": true, "answer_length": 1164, "verification_status": "no_evidence", "tool_calls": 10, "tool_failures": 0, "severity": 0, "trace_id": "eval_b4aed4d5:rag_easy_long_remote_sensing_survey", "tool_errors": 0, "step_count": 24, "duration_s": 40.2, "answer": "根据本地知识库检索结果，目前**仅能确认并获取完整方法描述的遥感图像变化描述（RSICC）论文共3篇**。其余匹配项（如“Cross-Temporal Remote Sensing Image Change Captioning”“Diffusion-RSCC”同名变体等）虽在检索中出现，但因未成功下载、未索引或内容不完整，**无法提取其核心方法**。以下为已确认的3篇论文及其核心方法（严格依据工具返回的摘要与方法节内容）：\n\n1. **Diffusion-RSCC: Diffusion Probabilistic Model for Change Captioning in Remote Sensing Images**  \n   提出基于扩散概率模型的RSICC方法：① 构建前向扩散过程，将离散词嵌入映射至标准高斯分布；② 设计条件去噪器（condition denoiser），融合双时相图像特征与文本表示；③ 在反向过程中引入跨模态融合模块和堆叠自注意力（SSA）模块，逐步从噪声中生成语义准确的变化描述。\n\n2. **Mask Approximation Net: A Novel Diffusion Model Approach for Remote Sensing Change Captioning**  \n   采用两阶段扩散范式：① **掩膜近似阶段**：先用多尺度变化检测模块生成初始变化掩膜，再通过UNet结构的去噪网络（MaskApproxNet）对其进行迭代 refine；② **文本解码阶段**：将 refined 掩膜特征输入文本解码器生成描述；③ 引入频域引导的复数滤波模块，在扩散过程中抑制高频噪声。\n\n3. **SAM Guided Semantic and Motion Changed Region Mining for Remote Sensing Change Captioning**  \n   基于SAM基础模型增强区域感知能力：① 使用CNN/Transformer提取全局视觉特征；② 利用SAM模型分别定位**运动级变化区域**（通过光流或差分）和**语义级变化区域**（通过分割掩膜）；③ 构建遥感变化知识图谱，显式建模地物对象关系；④ 通过交叉注意力融合多源信息（全局特征、SAM区域、知识图谱），由Transformer解码器生成最终描述。\n\n其余匹配论文（如Park et al. [33] 的Dual Dynamic Attention Model、Hoxha et al. [34] 的早期/晚期特征融合、Chouaf et al. [35] 的早期探索等）仅在相关工作综述中被提及，**本地知识库未提供其全文或方法细节，故无法陈述其核心方法**。", "intent": "literature_search", "prompt_tokens": 71768, "completion_tokens": 550, "tokens_total": 72318, "cost_usd": 0.0588, "contract_enabled": true, "contract_success": false, "contract_checks_passed": 6, "contract_checks_total": 10, "contract_success_rate": 0.6, "contract_failures": [{"name": "answer_contains:RSICCformer", "passed": false, "detail": ""}, {"name": "answer_contains:CTM", "passed": false, "detail": ""}, {"name": "answer_contains:SAGE-CC", "passed": false, "detail": ""}, {"name": "budget:tokens_total", "passed": false, "detail": "72318>48000"}], "contract_checks": [{"name": "required_tool:search_papers", "passed": true, "detail": "calls=['artifact_read', 'check_paper', 'fetch_content', 'search_papers']"}, {"name": "required_tool:fetch_content", "passed": true, "detail": "calls=['artifact_read', 'check_paper', 'fetch_content', 'search_papers']"}, {"name": "answer_contains:RSICCformer", "passed": false, "detail": ""}, {"name": "answer_contains:Diffusion-RSCC", "passed": true, "detail": ""}, {"name": "answer_contains:CTM", "passed": false, "detail": ""}, {"name": "answer_contains:SAGE-CC", "passed": false, "detail": ""}, {"name": "budget:duration_s", "passed": true, "detail": "40.2>420"}, {"name": "budget:tool_calls", "passed": true, "detail": "10>12"}, {"name": "budget:step_count", "passed": true, "detail": "24>30"}, {"name": "budget:tokens_total", "passed": false, "detail": "72318>48000"}], "postcondition_checks": 0, "category": "task_fail"}
